sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant CLI as llama-finetune
    participant llama as llama_context
    participant opt as ggml_opt
    participant cpu as ggml-cpu (ops)

    User->>CLI: launch with model + data
    CLI->>CLI: load model (no mmap)
    CLI->>CLI: tokenize input text
    CLI->>opt: ggml_opt_dataset_init(I32, I32, n_ctx, n_ctx, ndata, 1)
    opt-->>CLI: dataset handle

    loop for each epoch
        CLI->>opt: ggml_opt_epoch_callback_progress_bar
        CLI->>llama: llama_opt_epoch(ctx, dataset, result_train, result_eval, idata_split, callback)

        Note over llama,opt: Training split
        loop for each datapoint in training set
            llama->>llama: opt_epoch_iter(ctx, tokens, labels, batch)
            llama->>llama: build graph (forward)
            llama->>opt: ggml_opt_prepare_alloc(opt_ctx, gf, inputs, outputs)
            llama->>opt: ggml_opt_alloc(opt_ctx, backward=true)
            opt->>opt: determine build_type (GRAD or OPT)
            opt->>cpu: build backward graph
            llama->>llama: set one-hot labels
            llama->>opt: ggml_opt_eval(opt_ctx, result_train)
            opt->>cpu: compute forward
            cpu-->>opt: loss value
            alt GRAD phase
                opt->>cpu: compute backward (gradients)
                cpu-->>opt: gradients in grad_accs
            else OPT phase
                opt->>cpu: compute backward (gradients)
                opt->>opt: read optimizer params via callback
                opt->>opt: write adamw/sgd params tensor
                opt->>cpu: apply optimizer step
                cpu->>cpu: w = w*keep - alpha * mh/vh  (AdamW)
                cpu-->>opt: updated weights
            end
            opt-->>llama: result with loss/pred
            llama->>CLI: callback progress bar
        end

        Note over llama,opt: Validation split
        loop for each datapoint in validation set
            llama->>opt: ggml_opt_alloc(opt_ctx, backward=false)
            llama->>opt: ggml_opt_eval(opt_ctx, result_eval)
            opt->>cpu: forward pass only
            cpu-->>opt: loss value
            opt-->>llama: result with loss
            llama->>CLI: callback progress bar
        end
    end

    CLI->>CLI: llama_model_save_to_file(model, "finetuned-model.gguf")
